# The context for runtime/Dockerfile is the REPO ROOT (the runtime depends
# by path on crates/darkmux-trajectory). BuildKit reads this file, named for
# the Dockerfile beside it, instead of a root .dockerignore. Everything is
# excluded except what the Dockerfile copies, so the multi-GB target/ trees
# and the rest of the workspace never reach the daemon.
*
!runtime/Cargo.toml
!runtime/Cargo.lock
!runtime/src
!crates/darkmux-trajectory/Cargo.toml
!crates/darkmux-trajectory/src
